### Requer a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code. Servidor local: npm start (porta 3001)

### Saúde do servidor
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### Regras de funcionamento (horário, dias, "hoje" no fuso de São Paulo)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/config

### Serviços (público)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/services

### Horários livres de um dia para o serviço 1 (ajuste a data)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/availability?date=2026-12-15&service_id=1

### Cadastrar cliente (consent é obrigatório)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cliente Teste", "email": "cliente@teste.com", "password": "senha123", "consent": true }

### Login do cliente
# @name loginCliente
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "cliente@teste.com", "password": "senha123" }

###
@clientToken = {{loginCliente.response.body.token}}

### Agendar COM token de cliente (201). Ajuste a data para um dia útil futuro.
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{ "client_name": "Cliente Teste", "client_phone": "11999999999", "service_id": 1, "date": "2026-12-15", "time": "14:00" }

### Agendar SEM token (401)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "client_name": "Intruso", "client_phone": "11888888888", "service_id": 1, "date": "2026-12-15", "time": "15:00" }

### Mesmo horário de novo (409)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{ "client_name": "Outro", "client_phone": "11888888888", "service_id": 1, "date": "2026-12-15", "time": "14:00" }

### Horário fora do expediente (400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{ "client_name": "Cliente Teste", "client_phone": "11999999999", "service_id": 1, "date": "2026-12-15", "time": "03:00" }

### Meus agendamentos
GET http://localhost:3001/api/my-appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Listar TODOS os agendamentos com token de cliente (403)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Listar agendamentos sem token (401)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments

### Login do admin (use o e-mail e a senha reais)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3001/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "SEU_EMAIL_ADMIN", "password": "SUA_SENHA_ADMIN" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Listar agendamentos como admin (200)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
